{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GwiLW3kLj2KpaigYWEz8Du","type":"tool_result","content":"None\n:setting:`FILE_UPLOAD_PERMISSIONS` setting.\n\n.. setting:: FILE_UPLOAD_PERMISSIONS\n\n``FILE_UPLOAD_PERMISSIONS``\n---------------------------\n\nDefault: ``None``\n\nThe numeric mode (i.e. ``0o644``) to set newly uploaded files to. For\nmore information about what these modes mean, see the documentation for\n:func:`os.chmod`.\n\nIf this isn't given or is ``None``, you'll get operating-system\ndependent behavior. On most platforms, temporary files will have a mode\nof ``0o600``, and files saved from memory will be saved using the\nsystem's standard umask.\n\nFor security reasons, these permissions aren't applied to the temporary files\nthat are stored in :setting:`FILE_UPLOAD_TEMP_DIR`.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f6dbd07b-2aec-4e47-9ecf-32109227eca4","uuid":"be5fa228-7ac9-4469-a021-b495a5ef18ea","timestamp":"2026-11-22T23:18:37.059Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"None\n:setting:`FILE_UPLOAD_PERMISSIONS` setting.\n\n.. setting:: FILE_UPLOAD_PERMISSIONS\n\n``FILE_UPLOAD_PERMISSIONS``\n---------------------------\n\nDefault: ``None``\n\nThe numeric mode (i.e. ``0o644``) to set newly uploaded files to. For\nmore information about what these modes mean, see the documentation for\n:func:`os.chmod`.\n\nIf this isn't given or is ``None``, you'll get operating-system\ndependent behavior. On most platforms, temporary files will have a mode\nof ``0o600``, and files saved from memory will be saved using the\nsystem's standard umask.\n\nFor security reasons, these permissions aren't applied to the temporary files\nthat are stored in :setting:`FILE_UPLOAD_TEMP_DIR`.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01GwiLW3kLj2KpaigYWEz8Du","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
